      "art_form_vision": "ceramic",
      "vision_reason": "This is a stoneware ewer with iron-brown glaze, incised comb pattern, and a bird-shaped handle in relief — consistent with Khmer glazed stoneware ceramics from the Angkor period. It fits the claimed Khmer origin, though the category should be ceramic, not sculpture.",
